## Deep Investigation Report: Canvas Theme Editor Template

I've completed a thorough investigation of `packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/`. Here's the full report with technical details and code snippets:

---

## 1. Directory Structure

```
packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/
├── index.html                    # Template HTML shell with {{vars}}
├── package.json                  # Dependencies + dev server scripts
├── README.md                      # Feature guide + Canvas RCE notes
├── vite.config.ts.tmpl          # Empty Vite config template
├── scaffold.json                 # Scaffold metadata
├── tsconfig.json
├── src/
│   ├── main.ts.tmpl             # **2,000+ LOC** - Core app logic
│   ├── app.html                 # Split-pane UI + tray markup
│   ├── app.css                  # Flex layout + theme styling
│   └── i18n.json                # 32 UI string keys (Config/CSS/JS tabs, pane labels, etc.)
```

---

## 2. `index.html` (Layout Structure)

```html
