## 3. `src/main.ts` (Complete Architecture)

**~2,000 lines of vanilla TypeScript + DOM manipulation. Key sections:**

### 3.1 TinyMCE Initialization
```typescript
// Plugins registered: layouts (bundled starters), source-toggle (CodeMirror mode), 
