## 10. README Highlights (Features & Workflow)

| Feature | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Layouts** | Button inserts one of 5 bundled starters (hero, callout, 2-col, rubric, testimonial) — replaces whole doc |
| **Source view** | Toggle to syntax-highlighted CodeMirror HTML editor alongside WYSIWYG, with pantoken linter + autocomplete |
| **Live preview** | iframe with Canvas-compatible max-width wrapper, updated 300ms-debounced on edits |
| **Split-pane** | Resize (drag divider), swap (drag toolbar), stack (toggle orientation), fullscreen (per pane) |
| **Config tab** | CDN provider select + theme variant + mode selects; download links for theme.css/theme.js |
| **CSS/JS tabs** | Hand-editable CodeMirror + "Regenerate from config" button (auto-hides if not dirty) |
| **Copy HTML** | Button copies editor content to clipboard for pasting into Canvas RCE |
| **Help modal** | (?) button with workflow instructions |

---

## 11. Key Risks & Porting Challenges

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-----------|
| **TinyMCE SSR** | VitePress pre-renders at build (no `document`). TinyMCE will error. | Wrap in `<ClientOnly>`, dynamic import, skip tinymce.init() at build |
| **Large bundle** | TinyMCE (~2.5 MB) + CodeMirror + plugins = significant size. | Lazy-load, or accept & measure impact |
| **CodeMirror init timing** | Editor container must exist before EditorView creation. | Ensure mounted hook + nextTick before creating editors |
| **Fullscreen API in docs** | Might conflict with VitePress modal/overlay layers. | Test cross-frame; may need z-index hacks |
| **Popover API** | Used by theme-tray + help modal. Browser support varies. | VitePress already uses popover (check compat) |
| **IPC between views** | Swapping panes, updating source ↔ WYSIWYG seamlessly. | Use Vue ref + computed, not DOM-only state |
| **Pane resize drag** | Multiple pointer listeners; VitePress might have its own handlers. | Scope pointer capture, test carefully |

---

